				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "An Elixir module reference that does not resolve gets a wrench affordance: click it to create the module via the bridge. The pipeline is two halves running on every keystroke - a cheap local classify pass for rendering, and a rare create-module flow that fans recompile events back through the bus so the wrench disappears.\n\nBelow: each stage as its own section, opening with the picture or the code that already shows the shape, then prose for the non-obvious bits."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:30:37.104901+08:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:30:37.104901+08:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "9ZwHMemoSa28s3Z0INj00w=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## The local classifier\n\n{{gtClass:name=BeamModuleResolution}} is a class-side singleton holding two `Set`s, `resolved` (BEAM-confirmed loaded) and `unresolved` (BEAM-confirmed not loaded). Names in neither set are `#unknown`. {{gtMethod:name=BeamModuleResolution>>classify:}} is what the styler calls per AST node - cheap, no bridge.\n\nMaintenance is additive: a weak subscription to {{gtClass:name=BeamModuleRecompiled}} on the wildcard channel moves the named module from `unresolved` to `resolved` (see {{gtMethod:name=BeamModuleResolution>>recordResolved:unresolved:}}). No invalidation, no refresh. Inspect the singleton to read the current state:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:30:40.925154+08:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:30:40.925154+08:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
